==========================================================================

The longwave and shortwave radiation code and its k-distribution tables are derived from NCEP's
NMMB copy of AER's RRTMG (Mlawer, Iacono, Clough; shortwave data adapted from J. Delamere, AER, and
J.-J. Morcrette, ECMWF). They ship under AER's BSD 3-Clause licence, the licence AER applies to
RRTMG_LW and RRTMG_SW today:

  Copyright (c) 2002-2020, Atmospheric and Environmental Research, Inc. (AER).

Files covered (each carries AER's copyright line and "BSD-3-Clause; see NOTICE" in its header;
tools/licence_check.py holds the exact list):
  - kernels: namgpu/kernels/phys_rrtm_lw_*.cu (26), namgpu/kernels/phys_rrtm_sw_*.cu (25),
    namgpu/kernels/rrtm_sw_bands.cuh;
  - Python wrappers: namgpu/physics/rrtm/phys_rrtm_lw_*.py, namgpu/physics/rrtm/phys_rrtm_sw_*.py,
